From e16d668f1cd6903e25b5846b57df5120523390f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JSwetz <Johnswetz1982@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 00:13:28 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(post): Doosan DNM + Fanuc post processor (#614)

Add Doosan DNM milling post processor dialect (`doosan-dnm.cps`) based on Fanuc:
- Through-spindle coolant (TSC) support with M88 (and option for M8)
- 4th-axis rotary table brake unclamp (M11) and clamp (M10) on index moves
- Fanuc AI Contour Control (AICC) high-speed smoothing G05.1 Q1 / G05.1 Q0
- Chip conveyor start (M31) and stop (M33)
- Renishaw Inspection Plus and standard Fanuc G31 macro-B probing
- Doosan DNM 5700 machine definition (`assets/machines/doosan-dnm.mch`)
- Built-in post registry and conformance suite registration with goldens
- Unit tests in `crates/app/tests/doosan_dnm_post.rs`
- Decision record in `docs/decisions/614-doosan-dnm-post.md`

Changelog: Doosan DNM + Fanuc post processor with through-spindle coolant, 4th-axis rotary clamp/unclamp, G05.1 AICC smoothing, chip conveyor, and probing (#614)

Fixes #614
