+M8
+G00 X37.711 Y-6.306 Z5
+G00 X37.711 Y-6.306 Z2
+G01 X37.711 Y-6.306 Z0 F100
+G02 X40.346 Y-2.98 Z0 I2.98 J0.346 F500
+G03 X43 Y0 Z0 I-0.346 J2.98 F500
+G01 X43 Y20 Z0 F500
+G03 X40 Y23 Z0 I-3 J0 F500
+G01 X0 Y23 Z0 F500
+G03 X-3 Y20 Z0 I0 J-3 F500
+G01 X-3 Y0 Z0 F500
+G03 X0 Y-3 Z0 I3 J0 F500
+G01 X40 Y-3 Z0 F500
+G01 X40.346 Y-2.98 Z0 F500
+G02 X43.514 Y-5.802 Z0 I0.173 J-2.995 F500
+G01 X43.514 Y-5.802 Z2 F500
